# NOTE: backend/data/cache/ is intentionally shipped in the image. These are the
# precomputed ModelSpecification JSONs (~3.5 MB total) that let the first
# /api/model request load instantly from disk instead of triggering a heavy live
# build (ingest -> forecast -> valuation -> QA), which risks OOM/timeout on
# Render's free tier (512 MB). The runtime still writes new caches on demand.
